# This example is a Node project: its package.json, lockfile, rubric and
# ~12 MB of JSONL artifacts must be plain git files, not LFS pointers, or a
# clone without git-lfs cannot install, test or run the UI. Override the
# repo-wide LFS rules for these types here.
*.json  -filter -diff -merge text
*.jsonl -filter -diff -merge text
*.png   -filter -diff -merge
